<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on U.S. Treasuries.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on U.S. Treasuries.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued 10 million American-style put warrants on the 6.5 percent 2006 U.S. Treasury, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100.25 PCT		PREMIUM	3.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $2.42		     GEARING	42.06 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 12.NOV.96-30.JUL.97   PAYDATE	13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  101.78 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
